<name>Inwangsan Beombawi Course (Gyeongbokgung Stn → summit → Seochon)</name>
<description><![CDATA[A course up via the Tiger Statue and Beombawi, B course down via the Forest Shelter and Choso Bookshop, then 4 restaurants at Sejong Village Food Street. From the video by 책쓰는 미식가.<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fpuxVN6FQl4">Source video</a>]]></description>
