<Folder><name>Ascent – A course (Beombawi)</name>
<Placemark><name>Ascent: Gyeongbokgung Stn → Tiger Statue → Beombawi → summit (2.6 km, 1–1.5 h)</name><description><![CDATA[2.3 km<br>1. Sajik-ro north sidewalk: Exit 1 → CU → Sajikdan gate<br>2. Along the Sajikdan stone wall, right onto Inwangsan-ro (Jarak-gil) → Tiger Statue<br>3. Stairs from the Tiger Statue up to the fortress wall (not mapped in OSM) (approx.)<br>4. Hanyangdoseong wall path (inner side) → Beombawi<br>5. Beombawi → summit: granite cliff section, metal and stone stairs]]></description><styleUrl>#line-0</styleUrl><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>126.972215,37.576197,0 126.972171,37.576201,0 126.971948,37.576202,0 126.971699,37.576197,0 126.970995,37.576207,0 126.970923,37.576207,0 126.970400,37.576206,0 126.970327,37.576207,0 126.969998,37.576222,0 126.969880,37.576228,0 126.969885,37.576138,0 126.969763,37.576136,0 126.969616,37.576163,0 126.969295,37.576177,0 126.969168,37.576218,0 126.969125,37.576272,0 126.969077,37.576106,0 126.969026,37.576117,0 126.969002,37.576121,0 126.968977,37.575993,0 126.968815,37.575743,0 126.968803,37.575724,0 126.968716,37.575646,0 126.968668,37.575595,0 126.968574,37.575529,0 126.968187,37.575291,0 126.968145,37.575261,0 126.968012,37.575165,0 126.967648,37.574872,0 126.967609,37.574849,0 126.967560,37.574877,0 126.967456,37.574926,0 126.967246,37.575006,0 126.967006,37.575086,0 126.966706,37.575216,0 126.966506,37.575316,0 126.966276,37.575406,0 126.965966,37.575486,0 126.965866,37.575509,0 126.965782,37.575550,0 126.965741,37.575587,0 126.965716,37.575625,0 126.965650,37.575708,0 126.965621,37.575782,0 126.965607,37.575827,0 126.965590,37.575891,0 126.965562,37.576016,0 126.965529,37.576125,0 126.965410,37.576250,0 126.965289,37.576418,0 126.965242,37.576483,0 126.965191,37.576542,0 126.965200,37.576595,0 126.965087,37.576712,0 126.964952,37.576804,0 126.964702,37.576931,0 126.964237,37.577189,0 126.963989,37.577334,0 126.963900,37.577416,0 126.963799,37.577578,0 126.963695,37.577960,0 126.96364